    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cA comic-styled metaphysical retro-futuristic narrative adventure\u201d<br><br>Play as Wei Song, a retired technician and prize fighter driven to a fateful climb that ends in immortality and makes him an enemy of the most powerful man on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a distant future where humanity has successfully evacuated to Mars, \u2018Future Ghost\u2019 uses a combination of light point &amp; click gameplay with turn-based combat and varied mini-game style interludes and puzzles to tell Song\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tA complex narrative &amp; deep characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tGraphics reminiscent of mid-'80s comic print </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPoint &amp; click gameplay (also keyboard &amp; controller-friendly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOriginal soundtrack by Old Man May (Nigel Firth, ex-Vienna Ditto)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tJRPG-style turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPowerful starting moves and many more to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tCommon-sense problem-solving &quot;puzzles&quot; inspired by reality </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tFights that are intrinsically linked to the narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTimeline that fills in as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tManual levelling-up for custom stat-based character builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future Ghost is a blend of old-school 2D point &amp; click adventure game with JRPG-style battles thrown in, telling a genre-bending story 20 years in the making.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cA comic-styled metaphysical retro-futuristic narrative adventure\u201d<br><br>Play as Wei Song, a retired technician and prize fighter driven to a fateful climb that ends in immortality and makes him an enemy of the most powerful man on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a distant future where humanity has successfully evacuated to Mars, \u2018Future Ghost\u2019 uses a combination of light point &amp; click gameplay with turn-based combat and varied mini-game style interludes and puzzles to tell Song\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tA complex narrative &amp; deep characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tGraphics reminiscent of mid-'80s comic print </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPoint &amp; click gameplay (also keyboard &amp; controller-friendly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tOriginal soundtrack by Old Man May (Nigel Firth, ex-Vienna Ditto)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tJRPG-style turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPowerful starting moves and many more to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tCommon-sense problem-solving &quot;puzzles&quot; inspired by reality </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tFights that are intrinsically linked to the narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tTimeline that fills in as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tManual levelling-up for custom stat-based character builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future Ghost is a blend of old-school 2D point &amp; click adventure game with JRPG-style battles thrown in, telling a genre-bending story 20 years in the making.</p>",
